## psc/sema/annotate.pengu — anotaciones semánticas por nodo del AST.
##
## `SemaAnnotations.items[node_id]` guarda el tipo inferido, el símbolo
## resuelto y un payload auxiliar. F4 consume esta tabla en vez de volver a
## inferir. Las anotaciones se inicializan a `-1` y se rellenan on demand.
##
## ## Memoria
## `SemaAnnotations` es dueño de la lista; `free_annotations` la libera.

import psc.ast.node as psast

insignia sema_annotate_

## Hay tipo válido en `type_id`.
const ANN_HAS_TYPE as int is 1 << 0
## Hay símbolo resuelto en `symbol_id`.
const ANN_HAS_SYMBOL as int is 1 << 1
## Llamada a método `@mutates` reescrita a statement.
const ANN_MUTATING_CALL as int is 1 << 2
## `type_id`/`aux` describen una tupla.
const ANN_TUPLE as int is 1 << 3
## Es un valor de función/lambda.
const ANN_FN_VALUE as int is 1 << 4
## El nodo es el target de un `banish`.
const ANN_BANISH as int is 1 << 5
## El nodo ya pasó el chequeo de `judge`.
const ANN_JUDGE_CHECKED as int is 1 << 6
## `aux` es el `NameId` del C name resuelto.
const ANN_C_NAME as int is 1 << 7
## `aux` es el `TypeId` del binding `maybe`.
const ANN_BIND_MAYBE as int is 1 << 8
## `aux` es el `TypeId` del elemento del binding.
const ANN_BIND_ELEM as int is 1 << 9

## Anotación POD.
rune SemaAnnotation:
    ## Tipo inferido (`-1` sin anotar).
    type_id as int
    ## Símbolo resuelto (`-1` si no).
    symbol_id as int
    ## Payload auxiliar según flags.
    aux as int
    ## Bits `ANN_*`.
    flags as int

## Tabla de anotaciones.
##
## ## Memoria
## Dueña de `items`.
rune SemaAnnotations:
    ## Una entrada por nodo del AST.
    items as list of SemaAnnotation

## Crea una tabla con una entrada por nodo.
##
## ## Memoria
## Asigna la lista; liberar con `free_annotations`.
weave new_annotations with ast as ref to psast.PsAst into SemaAnnotations:
    var items as list of SemaAnnotation is list of SemaAnnotation
    var i as int is 0
    while i < ast->nodes.len:
        var a as SemaAnnotation is with type_id is -1, symbol_id is -1, aux is 0, flags is 0
        calling items.push with a
        set i is i + 1
    return with items is items

## Libera la tabla.
##
## ## Memoria
## Libera la lista.
weave free_annotations with a as ref to SemaAnnotations into void:
    banish a->items

## Obtiene la anotación de un nodo.
##
## ## Memoria
## Copia POD.
weave get with a as ref to SemaAnnotations, node as int into SemaAnnotation:
    if node < 0 or node >= a->items.len:
        return with type_id is -1, symbol_id is -1, aux is 0, flags is 0
    return (a->items at node)

## Guarda una anotación.
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1).
weave set with a as ref to SemaAnnotations, node as int, v as SemaAnnotation into void:
    if node < 0 or node >= a->items.len:
        return
    set a->items at (node) is v

## Marca el tipo de un nodo.
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1).
weave set_type with a as ref to SemaAnnotations, node as int, type_id as int into void:
    var v as SemaAnnotation is calling get with a, node
    set v.type_id is type_id
    set v.flags is v.flags | ANN_HAS_TYPE
    calling set with a, node, v

## Tipo de un nodo (`-1` si no).
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1).
weave type_of with a as ref to SemaAnnotations, node as int into int:
    return (calling get with a, node).type_id

## Marca el símbolo resuelto de un nodo.
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1).
weave ann_set_symbol with a as ref to SemaAnnotations, node as int, symbol as int into void:
    var v as SemaAnnotation is calling get with a, node
    set v.symbol_id is symbol
    set v.flags is v.flags | ANN_HAS_SYMBOL
    calling set with a, node, v

## Símbolo de un nodo (`-1` si no).
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1).
weave symbol_of with a as ref to SemaAnnotations, node as int into int:
    return (calling get with a, node).symbol_id

## Marca un flag.
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1).
weave add_flag with a as ref to SemaAnnotations, node as int, flag as int into void:
    var v as SemaAnnotation is calling get with a, node
    set v.flags is v.flags | flag
    calling set with a, node, v

## Guarda el auxiliar.
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1).
weave set_aux with a as ref to SemaAnnotations, node as int, aux as int into void:
    var v as SemaAnnotation is calling get with a, node
    set v.aux is aux
    calling set with a, node, v
